  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Thinking of studying in Malta? IDEA College might be exactly what you’re looking for. Known for programmes in business, IT, accounting, and leadership, IDEA gives you a mix of academic learning with practical experience. IDEA College is licensed and accredited by the Malta Further and Higher Education Authority (MFHEA).</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Your student life at IDEA will be inclusive and supportive. You’ll be part of small classes that offer you personalised learning opportunities and better interaction with professors.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>IDEA College does not offer accommodation on campus. However, you can search for suitable options nearby.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
